(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{\\operatorname{sin}⁡({e}^{t})}}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡({e}^{t})\\cdot {e}^{t} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({e}^{t})}{2\\sqrt{\\operatorname{sin}⁡({e}^{t})}}, \\\\ {y}^{′}(t) & =-{e}^{t}{csc}^{2}⁡({e}^{t}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{-{e}^{t}{csc}^{2}⁡({e}^{t})}{(\\frac{{e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({e}^{t})}{2\\sqrt{\\operatorname{sin}⁡({e}^{t})}})} \\\\  & =-\\,\\frac{2\\sqrt{\\operatorname{sin}⁡({e}^{t})}}{{sin}^{2}⁡({e}^{t})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({e}^{t})} \\\\  & =-\\,\\frac{2}{{sin}^{3/2}⁡({e}^{t})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({e}^{t})}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6}),$ the slope of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =-\\,\\frac{2}{{sin}^{3/2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})} \\\\  & =-\\,\\frac{2}{{(\\frac{1}{2})}^{3/2}(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})} \\\\  & =-2\\cdot {2}^{3/2}\\,\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\  & =-8\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533922 true] [17592186266125 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266126 13194139533922 true] [17592186266125 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266127 13194139533922 true] [17592186266125 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266128 13194139533922 true] [17592186266125 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266129 13194139533922 true] [17592186266125 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266130 13194139533922 true] [17592186266125 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533922 true] [17592186266125 1041 "selection" 13194139533922 true] [17592186266125 1104 #edb/ref 17592186266127 13194139533922 true] [17592186266125 1110 #uuid "20fac6dc-1a76-5c25-8248-d059f90b59ed" 13194139533922 true] [17592186266126 1034 "-2\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}" 13194139533922 true] [17592186266126 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533922 true] [17592186266126 1111 #uuid "659156af-3182-5003-9f1d-d78fc42cd2c0" 13194139533922 true] [17592186266127 1034